flowchart TD
    A[User Input<br/>Owner, pet, tasks] --> B[Task Intake & Context Builder]
    B --> C[Retriever<br/>Looks up relevant pet-care guidance]
    C --> D[Planning Agent<br/>Builds and explains schedule]
    D --> E[Scheduler Engine<br/>Orders tasks and resolves conflicts]
    E --> F[Evaluator<br/>Checks reliability and plan quality]
    F --> G[Output<br/>Scheduled plan with explanation]

    H[Human Reviewer<br/>Confirms plan and edits priorities] --> B
    H --> G

    I[Testing Harness<br/>Runs scenarios and checks consistency] --> F
    I --> H

    style A fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style C fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0
    style D fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00
    style E fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a
    style F fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b
    style G fill:#e0f2f1,stroke:#00695c
    style H fill:#f9fbe7,stroke:#827717
    style I fill:#f1f8e9,stroke:#558b2f
